[thin] Specific lettering and plate section:
- 0.818 mm is a stroke of the DATA lettering, the bulkhead labels' font at their word size.
- 1.68 mm is the plate and its two wings, the depth of the accepted flat-wing nameplate interface the plate shares (data-ring/README.md; nameplate/horizontal-wing-trial/physical-acceptance.json).
alternatives: Heavier strokes change the font the six rear labels share. A thicker plate or wing needs a thicker receiver slot or a thinner retaining lip, each a change to the accepted wing fit.
